# LF in the repo and LF on disk, on every machine.
#
# Without this, git on Windows checks out CRLF while the generators write LF,
# so `pnpm bundles:build --check` compares 1866 bytes against 1837 and reports
# the manifest stale on a clone that has not changed a thing. First command of
# `pnpm gates`, so a fresh clone failed before it ran a single test.
* text=auto eol=lf
